<title>JAPAN: Ga-jo-en - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Ga-jo-en - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to August 31, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		412 million	 vs	  463 million</p>
<p> Operating   loss 219 million	 vs   loss 192 million</p>
<p> Current     loss 220 million	 vs   loss 193 million</p>
<p> Net	     loss 5.18		vs   loss 213 million</p>
<p> EPS	    loss 91.64 yen	  vs     loss 4.50 yen</p>
<p> Shares		57 million	 vs	   47 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Ga-jo-en Kanko KK operates a chain of hotels.</p>
</text>
